[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":176},"routes/guides.$slug",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"guide",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":30},"title","Gifts for the Man Who Has Everything: 12 Ideas He Does Not Own Yet","slug","gifts-for-the-man-who-has-everything","category","gifts-for-him","seoTitle","Gifts for the Man Who Has Everything: 12 Unique Ideas (2026)","metaDescription","Shopping for the man who has everything? 12 unique gifts he does not own yet: clever gadgets, experiences in a box and luxe upgrades, all loved by real buyers.","image","https://images.pexels.com/photos/9169327/pexels-photo-9169327.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1216&h=912&fit=crop","imageAlt","A man opening a gift box","intro","He buys what he wants the second he wants it. His birthday list says \"nothing.\" And every Christmas you stand in a store thinking: what do you even get this guy? Here is the secret: stop looking for things he needs. Look for things he would never think to buy, but will love the second he opens them. Every gift here is a little surprising, a little fun, and loved by thousands of buyers. Our top pick: the whiskey smoker kit. It turns any drink into a bar-worthy cocktail, and it is a show every time he uses it.","sections",[81,82,83,84],"comparison",{"_45":46,"_47":48},"faq",[31,32,33,34],{"_35":43,"_37":44},{"_35":41,"_37":42},{"_35":39,"_37":40},{"_35":36,"_37":38},"question","When should I order so it arrives for Christmas?","answer","By mid-December for most items. Engraved and personalized gifts take longer, so order those first.","What is a good sentimental gift for a man who has everything?","Engraved whiskey glasses or a gift you share, like a couples card game. For more ideas, see our sentimental gifts for him guide.","What is a unique gift for a man who has everything?","A whiskey smoker kit. Most men have never seen one, it turns any drink into a show, and it looks great on a home bar.","What do you get a man who has everything?","Something he would never buy himself: a clever gadget like a whiskey smoker kit or a smart mug, an experience like a wooden model to build, or a gift you enjoy together, like a 100 dates poster.","columns",[78,79,80],"rows",[49,50,51,52,53,54],{"_55":75,"_57":76},{"_55":72,"_57":73},{"_55":69,"_57":70},{"_55":65,"_57":66},{"_55":61,"_57":62},{"_55":56,"_57":58},"label","100 Dates poster","values",[59,60],"Time together","Medium, lasts all year","Globe decanter set",[63,64],"His home bar","Very high","UGEARS wooden clock",[67,68],"Guys who like projects","High","Instax Mini 12",[71,68],"Trips and memories","Ember Mug 2",[74,68],"Coffee every morning","Whiskey smoker kit",[77,64],"Whiskey and cocktail lovers","Gift","Best for","Wow factor",{"_85":155,"_87":156,"_89":157},{"_85":128,"_87":129,"_89":130},{"_85":107,"_87":108,"_89":109},{"_85":86,"_87":88,"_89":90},"heading","Gifts that are really about the two of you","text","When he truly has everything, give him more time with you. These are the gifts that turn into dates, laughs and stories you will tell for years.","products",[91,92],{"_93":102,"_19":103,"_96":104,"_98":105,"_100":106},{"_93":94,"_19":95,"_96":97,"_98":99,"_100":101},"name","Best night in: We're Not Really Strangers Couples Edition","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6803654/pexels-photo-6803654.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","alt","Couple playing cards with glasses of wine","description","The viral card game, made for couples. Questions that start funny and get deep fast. Over 2,700 reviews say the same thing: you will learn something new about him.","amazonUrl","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7V56B7H?tag=relations0237-20","Best for couples: 100 Dates scratch-off poster","https://images.pexels.com/photos/5911298/pexels-photo-5911298.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Happy couple on a date in a cafe","100 date ideas hidden under scratch-off squares. Scratch one, do it, take a photo. It hangs on the wall and keeps you busy all year. Over 2,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TQNMHVP?tag=relations0237-20","Luxe upgrades of things he already owns","He has a glass, a pocket knife and a bottle of whiskey. But does he have the nice version? These are the upgrades he would never buy for himself, and he will notice the difference every time.",[110,111,112],{"_93":123,"_19":124,"_96":125,"_98":126,"_100":127},{"_93":118,"_19":119,"_96":120,"_98":121,"_100":122},{"_93":113,"_19":114,"_96":115,"_98":116,"_100":117},"Best personal touch: engraved whiskey glasses set of 2","https://images.pexels.com/photos/36322545/pexels-photo-36322545.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Two whiskey glasses on a dark background","Two rocks glasses engraved with his initial. The thing he would never buy himself, and the one he reaches for every time. Over 400 reviews and 4.7 stars.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B93L5ZMH?tag=relations0237-20","Best tool: LEATHERMAN Charge+ TTI multi-tool","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6432919/pexels-photo-6432919.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Man holding a multi-tool in a leather case","19 tools in one, from pliers and scissors to a premium steel blade. The serious version of the cheap multi-tool he has in a drawer. Comes with a 25-year warranty.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079MJHYKC?tag=relations0237-20","Best for the whiskey shelf: PONPUR globe decanter set","https://images.pexels.com/photos/27837062/pexels-photo-27837062.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Whiskey decanter on a wooden table","A glass globe decanter with two globe glasses and whiskey stones. It looks like it belongs in a movie office. Over 1,700 reviews, 4.8 stars.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZKYR7FL?tag=relations0237-20","Experiences in a box","The man who has everything does not need more stuff. He needs something to do. These gifts give him a project, a new hobby or a fun night, and the memory lasts longer than the box.",[131,132,133,134],{"_93":150,"_19":151,"_96":152,"_98":153,"_100":154},{"_93":145,"_19":146,"_96":147,"_98":148,"_100":149},{"_93":140,"_19":141,"_96":142,"_98":143,"_100":144},{"_93":135,"_19":136,"_96":137,"_98":138,"_100":139},"For the foodie: TRUFF black truffle hot sauce","https://images.pexels.com/photos/25003519/pexels-photo-25003519.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Jars of red hot sauce","The fancy hot sauce that foodies talk about: chili, habanero and real black truffle. It makes eggs, pizza and tacos taste like a restaurant. Over 5,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H7T9TKKB?tag=relations0237-20","For the snacker: Jack Link's jerky gift basket","https://images.pexels.com/photos/37091572/pexels-photo-37091572.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Beef jerky with spices","A box full of jerky, meat sticks and more, in different flavors. Cheesy? A little. Will he finish it in a week? Absolutely. Over 2,400 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GHCJMDGZ?tag=relations0237-20","Best project: UGEARS Aero Clock wooden model","https://images.pexels.com/photos/35728143/pexels-photo-35728143.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Wooden gears close-up","A 3D wooden puzzle that turns into a real working clock, no glue needed. A few evenings of focus, and then it sits on his desk ticking. Almost 4,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094994SJT?tag=relations0237-20","Best for memories: Fujifilm Instax Mini 12 camera","https://images.pexels.com/photos/3945342/pexels-photo-3945342.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Instant camera on a wooden table","Point, shoot, and a real photo pops out of the camera. Perfect for trips, parties and date nights. Stick the photos on the fridge and watch him smile every time. Over 1,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWNYBRNL?tag=relations0237-20","Clever gadgets he did not know existed","He has a phone, a watch and every charger ever made. But he does not have these. They solve tiny daily problems he has never even thought about, and that is exactly why they feel special.",[158,159,160],{"_93":171,"_19":172,"_96":173,"_98":174,"_100":175},{"_93":166,"_19":167,"_96":168,"_98":169,"_100":170},{"_93":161,"_19":162,"_96":163,"_98":164,"_100":165},"For winter walks: Foxelli Bluetooth beanie","https://images.pexels.com/photos/8133386/pexels-photo-8133386.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Man in a knit beanie holding headphones","A warm knit beanie with headphones built in, plus a mic for calls. Music on his runs, no earbuds falling out in the cold. Fully washable, with over 2,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T6QBZC2?tag=relations0237-20","For the coffee guy: Ember Mug 2","https://images.pexels.com/photos/1210020/pexels-photo-1210020.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Ceramic mug of hot coffee on a desk","A smart mug that keeps his coffee at the exact temperature he likes, set from his phone. No more cold coffee after one long email. Over 21,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NQSR1DD?tag=relations0237-20","Top pick: whiskey smoker kit with torch","https://images.pexels.com/photos/16806518/pexels-photo-16806518.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Cocktail with smoke in a glass at a bar","Wood chips, a torch and a smoker top that turns any old fashioned into a smoky, bar-quality drink. Comes with 2 glasses and ice molds. Over 6,800 reviews, and he will make one for every guest who visits.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJV68C17?tag=relations0237-20",{"_177":178},"origin","https://relationshipgoals.store"]
